    3: ['Backgrounds', 'My shop sells backgrounds from across the globe! Quite interesting, don\'t you think?', 'If you\'ve always wanted to travel Neopia but are short on funds, a background is just the thing for you. After all, why wear white when you can wear Kreludor?!'],
    4: ['Trinkets', 'Is someone there? *puts on goggles* Ah! Welcome to Tinkered Trinkets!', 'We sell the finest trinkets in all of Neopia – right here in this shop! I mean, just look at my work bench. Impressive, no? We only use the best parts and guarantee against explosions!'],
    5: ['Superpacks', 'My friend and I here have everything you need for a new ensemble!', 'We\'ve put together a whole bunch of new outfits for you and put each one in a Superpack! Every pack contains all the pieces you\'ll need, so this really is a one-stop-shop for style!'],
