    8: ['Specialty', 'Hey, you! Don\'t touch that!', 'I\'ve scoured the globe for these very special, mint condition items. Hands off, please! Well, unless you make a purchase. Then you can have the item... as long as you promise to keep it in the box.'],
    9: ['Faerie Shoppe', 'Greetings, Neopian. Welcome to my shop. Please, come in!', 'If you\'re painted faerie (or are just a fan of faeries), this effervescent merchandise is for you. Let me know if you need assistance! I\'m happy to help.'],
    10: ['Virtupets', 'Hello, space traveller! Welcome to the intergalactic section of the NC Mall!', 'If you enjoy space as much as I do (and who doesn\'t?), then you\'ll love my shop! Please ask if you\'d like a demonstration of any item. Some of this technology is, well… let’s just say that not everything in here has been fully tested.'],
    11: ['Halloween', 'BOO! Welcome to the spookiest shop in the NC Mall!', 'We have everything you\'d ever want for Halloween and more! Take a look around, just watch out for the cobwebs.'],
