    13: ['Elite Boutique', 'Welcome to my fine establishment. You must be one of the Neopian Elite if you are here at my store!', 'I am sure you will be pleased with our fine and rare merchandise. Be assured that only those who are in the know will be in my shop.'],
    19: ['Holiday', 'Hi there! Welcome to the Holiday Shop!', 'You\'ll find all sorts of great items to get into the festive spirit!'],
    21: ['Wings', 'No need to wing it when it comes to fashion — with these items I can help you soar!', 'Have you ever wondered what it\'s like to fly through the skies and feel the breeze in your fur? Well look no further, because these wings I\'m selling will make you float like a Flosset and feel light as a feather!'],
    23: ['Faerie Doll', '', ''],
