    35: ['Negg Shop', 'Hi! Are you a collector? I collect Neggs as you can see.', 'You should check out my collection and maybe buy something. You just have to assure me that you wouldn\'t want to eat the Neggs!'],
    37: ['Spring', 'Do you like flowers? Fresh flowers are my favourite thing in the whole world!', 'Feel free to peruse my merchandise. There are a lot of wonderful Spring items for sale.'],
    39: ['Summer', 'Why hello! It is warm out here, is it not?', 'Please check out all of my wonderful summer-themed merchandise. Whether you want clothes or accessories, I have all types of summer fun for sale!'],
    40: ['Mystery Capsules', 'What could be inside...? Oh, I can\'t wait to find out!', 'Neverending excitement and entertainment in every Mystery Capsule! Half the fun is in opening it up and seeing what you get... and the other half is in opening the next!'],
    42: ['Neopets', 'Hello and welcome to my shoppe! Looking for anything in particular?', 'We\'ve recently expanded our selection to meet your ever-changing Neopet needs! On our well-stocked shelves, you\'ll find everything from clothing to trinkets to accessories. So come on in and take a look... I have a feeling you’ll like what you find!'],
    43: ['Clothing', 'Well, hello! Are you looking for something to wear?', 'I\'ve got everything you need to dress for success! Try on whatever you like, see how it fits, see how it feels—after all, we want to find what suits you!'],
    44: ['Shoes', 'Darn it! I knew I should have put on some shoes today... Let\'s see what we can cobble together to fix this mess!', 'A sturdy, stylish shoe is the first step in a successful outfit, so you\'d think I\'d have remembered to put my own on today... Oh well! My wares are both formal and functional, so try them on for size we\'ll see what suits you best.'],
    51: ['Food', 'Why hello there! Come on in, I\'ve got just the treat to perk up your pet.', 'Each of my culinary creations is guaranteed to give your Neopet just the energy boost they need. No matter what your favoured flavour is, I promise you\'ll love what I\'m cooking up, so come on in and have a bite!'],
    52: ['New', 'Style is all about what\'s new… good thing that\'s all I stock!', 'Come browse my shop and find the latest and greatest the NC Mall has to offer!'],
