    71: ['St. Patrick\'s', '', ''],
    73: ['Green', 'No need to be green with envy, just be green!', 'Green is great, especially when it comes to the items in this shop! You may want to hurry though, I\'m not open for very long!'],
    81: ['Altador Cup', 'Hi! Welcome to my Altador Cup Shop!', 'We\'ve stocked the shelves with all sorts of Altador Cup-inspired items. Be sure to grab the latest gear bags, and you\'ll be cheering your team on in style! Well, enjoy looking around... I\'ll be right over here if you need me!'],
    82: ['Birthday', 'Happy Birthday NC Mall!', 'Check out our Birthday-inspired items! With a mix of new birthday items and some old favourites, you\'re sure to find something here that makes you want to celebrate!'],
